---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
import { strings } from '../../i18n'
const t = strings.ko
---

<Base
  lang="ko"
  title="설치 — gadak"
  description="gadak 설치: Homebrew(macOS·Linux), Windows 릴리즈 zip."
>
  <h1>{t.install.heading}</h1>

  <h2>macOS</h2>
  <pre><code>{`brew install --cask midagedev/tap/gadak   # 앱 (CLI 포함)
brew install midagedev/tap/gadak-cli     # CLI만`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Linux</h2>
  <pre><code>{`brew install midagedev/tap/gadak-cli     # Homebrew 리눅스 경로

# 또는 아키텍처별 릴리즈 타볼:
# https://github.com/midagedev/gadak/releases`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Windows</h2>
  <pre><code>{`# 릴리즈 zip (포터블):
# https://github.com/midagedev/gadak/releases`}</code></pre>

  <h2>처음 실행</h2>
  <pre><code>{`# 회사 워크스페이스에 연결
gadak init && gadak sync && gadak serve

# 또는 트래커 없이 시작
gadak init --standalone
gadak create "방금 생각난 일"
gadak serve`}</code></pre>
</Base>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin: 4rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  pre {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--code-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
